<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_manual_restart">ActionManualRestart</link></para>

<para>This class handles the manual restart of services in the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It stops all running services, kills all related processes, and sets the application to restart. </para>
