                This constructor initializes the manual restart process by performing the following steps:<orderedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Starts the loading process.</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Deletes all services managed by <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link>.</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Kills all related processes.</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Sets the application to restart.</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Stops the loading process. </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
